 vendor/golang.org/x/sys/unix/asm_linux_ppc64x.s |   16 ++++++++--------
 1 file changed, 8 insertions(+), 8 deletions(-)

Index: cli/vendor/golang.org/x/sys/unix/asm_linux_ppc64x.s
